    "publicPageText": "A-\nA\nA+\nHindi\nPassport Seva\nMinistry of External Affairs, Government of India\nUser Registration\nRegister to apply at*\n(Select the 'CPV Delhi' to apply for Diplomatic/Official passport at Consular, Passport and Visa (CPV) division, Delhi.) \nCPV Delhi\nPassport Office\n Full Name \n*\n (Initials and honorifics (e.g. Dr., Col.) are not allowed) \n Email ID \n*\n Do you want your Login Id to be same as E-mail Id? \n*\nYes\nNo\n Login ID \n*\nCheck Availability\n Password \n*\n⟳\n Enter the characters shown in the image \n*\nSign Up\nClear\nAlready have an Account? \nSign In\nATTENTION – PLEASE READ BEFORE PROCEEDING\n•\nIf an applicant wants to Reissue his/her passport from a different Regional Passport Office other than the one where his/her present passport is issued, then he/she is required to create a new login ID on the Passport Seva Portal. The new login ID can be created using the same email ID that was previously used.\n•\nTo create a new login ID, click on “Register”. After completing the registration process, select “Passport Office” and then choose any PSK/RPO from the available options as per your convenience.\n•\nApplicants may apply for passport services at any PSK/RPO across India based on their preference.\nWELCOME TO PASSPORT SEVA\nDelivering passport services to citizens in a timely, accessible, reliable manner"
